text: ['Apocalypse Hydra enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it. If X is 5 or more, it enters the battlefield with an additional X +1/+1 counters on it.\n{1}{R}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Apocalypse Hydra: It deals 1 damage to any target.', "As Nyxathid enters the battlefield, choose an opponent.\nNyxathid gets -1/-1 for each card in the chosen player's hand.", "At the beginning of each player's draw step, that player draws two additional cards.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if you control a black permanent, you may put a +1/+1 counter on Bloodhall Ooze.\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, if you control a green permanent, you may put a +1/+1 counter on Bloodhall Ooze.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Wild Leotau unless you pay {G}.', "Banefire deals X damage to any target.\nIf X is 5 or more, this spell can't be countered and the damage can't be prevented.", 'Cliffrunner Behemoth has haste as long as you control a red permanent.\nCliffrunner Behemoth has lifelink as long as you control a white permanent.', 'Counter target noncreature spell. Its controller loses 2 life.', 'Counter target spell.\nBasic landcycling {1}{U} ({1}{U}, Discard this card: Search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', "Counter target spell. If that spell is countered this way, put it on top of its owner's library instead of into that player's graveyard.", 'Court Homunculus gets +1/+1 as long as you control another artifact.', 'Create X 1/1 white Soldier creature tokens. If X is 5 or more, destroy all other creatures.', 'Creatures you control get +1/+2 until end of turn. Untap those creatures.\nBasic landcycling {1}{W} ({1}{W}, Discard this card: Search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', 'Creatures your opponents control get -1/-0.', 'Dark Temper deals 2 damage to target creature. If you control a black permanent, destroy the creature instead.', 'Defender, flying\nAt the beginning of your end step, you may gain life equal to the power of target creature you control.', 'Destroy target artifact creature.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment. If that permanent was blue or black, draw a card.', 'Destroy target creature if it has the least power or is tied for least power among creatures on the battlefield.', 'Devour 1 (As this enters the battlefield, you may sacrifice any number of creatures. This creature enters the battlefield with that many +1/+1 counters on it.)\nHellkite Hatchling has flying and trample if it devoured a creature.', 'Domain — Create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token for each basic land type among lands you control.', 'Domain — Equipped creature gets +1/+1 for each basic land type among lands you control.\nEquip {3}', 'Domain — Look at the top X cards of your library, where X is the number of basic land types among lands you control. Put one of those cards into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', "Domain — Matca Rioters's power and toughness are each equal to the number of basic land types among lands you control.", 'Domain — Search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle. Exploding Borders deals X damage to target player or planeswalker, where X is the number of basic land types among lands you control.', 'Domain — Target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn for each basic land type among lands you control.', 'Domain — Target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn for each basic land type among lands you control.', 'Domain — Target player discards a card for each basic land type among lands you control.', 'Domain — {3}: Wandering Goblins gets +1/+0 until end of turn for each basic land type among lands you control.', 'Double strike\n{B}{G}: Viashino Slaughtermaster gets +1/+1 until end of turn. Activate only once each turn.', 'Draw cards equal to the power of target creature you control.', 'Enchant Forest or Plains\nWhenever enchanted land becomes tapped, its controller loses 2 life.', "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and can't block.", 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+3 and has flying.\nWhenever enchanted creature deals damage to a player, that player discards two cards.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature has flying, first strike, and vigilance.', 'Enchant creature\nWhen a creature dies, destroy enchanted creature.', "Enchant red or green creature\nEnchanted creature doesn't untap during its controller's untap step.", 'Equipped creature gets +1/+0.\nEquip {1} ({1}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', 'Exalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\nWhen Rhox Bodyguard enters the battlefield, you gain 3 life.', 'Exalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\n{T}: Add {G}, {W}, or {U}.', 'Exalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\n{T}: Destroy target creature that dealt damage to you this turn.', 'Exalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\n{U}, {T}: Draw a card, then discard a card.', 'Exile target black or red permanent.', 'Exile target creature. Its controller may search their library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Fiery Fall deals 5 damage to target creature.\nBasic landcycling {1}{R} ({1}{R}, Discard this card: Search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', 'First strike\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}: Until end of turn, Dragonsoul Knight becomes a Dragon, gets +5/+3, and gains flying and trample.', 'First strike\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}: Until end of turn, Paragon of the Amesha becomes an Angel, gets +3/+3, and gains flying and lifelink.', 'Flash\nDevour 1 (As this enters the battlefield, you may sacrifice any number of creatures. This creature enters the battlefield with that many +1/+1 counters on it.)', 'Flying', "Flying\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, return an artifact you control to its owner's hand.", 'Flying\nDeathtouch (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)\n{2}{R}: Pestilent Kathari gains first strike until end of turn.', 'Flying\nDevour 1 (As this enters the battlefield, you may sacrifice any number of creatures. This creature enters the battlefield with that many +1/+1 counters on it.)\nWhen Voracious Dragon enters the battlefield, it deals damage to any target equal to twice the number of Goblins it devoured.', "Flying\nDomain — Aven Trailblazer's toughness is equal to the number of basic land types among lands you control.", 'Flying\nExalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)', 'Flying\nWhen Faerie Mechanist enters the battlefield, look at the top three cards of your library. You may reveal an artifact card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', "Flying\nWhen Magister Sphinx enters the battlefield, target player's life total becomes 10.", 'Flying\nWhen Malfegor enters the battlefield, discard your hand. Each opponent sacrifices a creature for each card discarded this way.', 'Flying\nWhen Parasitic Strix enters the battlefield, if you control a black permanent, target player loses 2 life and you gain 2 life.', 'Flying\nWhen Sphinx Summoner enters the battlefield, you may search your library for an artifact creature card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Flying\nWhenever Maelstrom Archangel deals combat damage to a player, you may cast a spell from your hand without paying its mana cost.', 'Flying\nWhenever another creature leaves the battlefield, you may have target player mill two cards.\nUnearth {2}{B} ({2}{B}: Return this card from your graveyard to the battlefield. It gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step or if it would leave the battlefield. Unearth only as a sorcery.)', 'Flying\nYou may cast Worldheart Phoenix from your graveyard by paying {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} rather than paying its mana cost. If you do, it enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it.', "Flying\n{1}{G}{U}: Creatures you control gain shroud until end of turn. (They can't be the targets of spells or abilities.)", 'Flying\n{1}{W}{B}, {T}: Destroy target creature or enchantment.\n{2}{U}: Untap Ethersworn Adjudicator.', 'Flying\n{B}: Darklit Gargoyle gets +2/-1 until end of turn.', 'Flying, trample\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, each player loses 1 life. Put a +1/+1 counter on Blood Tyrant for each 1 life lost this way.\nWhenever a player loses the game, put five +1/+1 counters on Blood Tyrant.', 'Haste\n{R}, {T}: Create a 3/1 red Elemental creature token with haste.', 'Ignite Disorder deals 3 damage divided as you choose among one, two, or three target white and/or blue creatures.', 'Knight of the Reliquary gets +1/+1 for each land card in your graveyard.\n{T}, Sacrifice a Forest or Plains: Search your library for a land card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'Prevent all noncombat damage that would be dealt to creatures you control.', 'Protection from artifacts', 'Protection from black', 'Protection from blue', "Protection from everything\nIf Progenitus would be put into a graveyard from anywhere, reveal Progenitus and shuffle it into its owner's library instead.", 'Protection from green', 'Protection from red', 'Protection from white', "Quenchable Fire deals 3 damage to target player or planeswalker. It deals an additional 3 damage to that player or planeswalker at the beginning of your next upkeep step unless that player or that planeswalker's controller pays {U} before that step.", 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)\nAs long as you control a red permanent, Ember Weaver gets +1/+0 and has first strike.', "Return target creature to its owner's hand.", 'Rupture Spire enters the battlefield tapped.\nWhen Rupture Spire enters the battlefield, sacrifice it unless you pay {1}.\n{T}: Add one mana of any color.', 'Sacrifice Suicidal Charge: Creatures your opponents control get -1/-1 until end of turn. Those creatures attack this turn if able.', 'Sacrifice a creature: Put a +1/+1 counter on Scarland Thrinax.', 'Salvage Slasher gets +1/+0 for each artifact card in your graveyard.', 'Search your library for a Plains card, an Island card, a Swamp card, and a Mountain card. Reveal those cards, put them into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for a white card, a blue card, a black card, a red card, and a green card. Reveal those cards, put them into your hand, then shuffle.', "Shambling Remains can't block.\nUnearth {B}{R} ({B}{R}: Return this card from your graveyard to the battlefield. It gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step or if it would leave the battlefield. Unearth only as a sorcery.)", "Target creature gains flying until end of turn. If you control a white permanent, return View from Above to its owner's hand.", 'Target creature gets -3/-0 until end of turn.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Target opponent reveals cards from the top of their library until they reveal a creature card. That player puts all noncreature cards revealed this way into their graveyard, then you put the creature card onto the battlefield under your control.', 'Target player gains 8 life.\nBasic landcycling {1}{G} ({1}{G}, Discard this card: Search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', 'Target player loses 4 life and you gain 4 life.\nBasic landcycling {1}{B} ({1}{B}, Discard this card: Search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', "This spell can't be countered.\nVolcanic Fallout deals 2 damage to each creature and each player.", 'Toxic Iguanar has deathtouch as long as you control a green permanent. (Any amount of damage a creature with deathtouch deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)', "Trample\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, if you control a blue permanent, you may create a token that's a copy of Mirror-Sigil Sergeant.", "Trample\nIslandwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an Island.)\nShroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)", "Trample\nWhen Child of Alara dies, destroy all nonland permanents. They can't be regenerated.", 'Trample\nWhenever Charnelhoard Wurm deals damage to an opponent, you may return target card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Trample, haste\nAt the beginning of the end step, sacrifice Hellspark Elemental.\nUnearth {1}{R} ({1}{R}: Return this card from your graveyard to the battlefield. It gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step or if it would leave the battlefield. Unearth only as a sorcery.)', "Vigilance\n{R}, {T}: Target creature can't block this turn.\n{G}, {T}: Target creature blocks this turn if able.", "Vigilance\n{T}: Reveal the top card of your library. If it's a land card, put it onto the battlefield. Otherwise, put it into your hand.", "Vigilance, trample\nWhenever Meglonoth blocks a creature, Meglonoth deals damage to that creature's controller equal to Meglonoth's power.", 'When Brackwater Elemental attacks or blocks, sacrifice it at the beginning of the next end step.\nUnearth {2}{U} ({2}{U}: Return this card from your graveyard to the battlefield. It gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step or if it would leave the battlefield. Unearth only as a sorcery.)', 'When Grixis Slavedriver leaves the battlefield, create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token.\nUnearth {3}{B} ({3}{B}: Return this card from your graveyard to the battlefield. It gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step or if it would leave the battlefield. Unearth only as a sorcery.)', 'When Kaleidostone enters the battlefield, draw a card.\n{5}, {T}, Sacrifice Kaleidostone: Add {W}{U}{B}{R}{G}.', 'When Rhox Meditant enters the battlefield, if you control a green permanent, draw a card.', 'When Rotting Rats enters the battlefield, each player discards a card.\nUnearth {1}{B} ({1}{B}: Return this card from your graveyard to the battlefield. It gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step or if it would leave the battlefield. Unearth only as a sorcery.)', "When Sedraxis Alchemist enters the battlefield, if you control a blue permanent, return target nonland permanent to its owner's hand.", 'When Tukatongue Thallid dies, create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.', 'Whenever Infectious Horror attacks, each opponent loses 2 life.', 'Whenever an opponent draws a card, if you control a red permanent, you may have Kederekt Parasite deal 1 damage to that player.', 'Whenever another artifact enters the battlefield under your control or another artifact you control leaves the battlefield, you may pay {1}. If you do, target player loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever another creature with power 5 or greater enters the battlefield under your control, you may return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Whenever you cast an enchantment spell, create a 4/4 white Angel creature token with flying.', 'You have no maximum hand size.\n{T}: Add {C}.', "[+3]: Destroy target noncreature permanent.\n[−2]: Gain control of target creature.\n[−9]: Nicol Bolas, Planeswalker deals 7 damage to target player or planeswalker. That player or that planeswalker's controller discards seven cards, then sacrifices seven permanents.", '{1}, {T}: Add one mana of any color.', '{1}, {T}: Add {R}{G}{W}.', '{1}: Regenerate target creature with power 5 or greater.', '{1}: Target creature with power 5 or greater gains vigilance until end of turn.', '{1}{B}, {T}: Target player discards a card. Activate only during your turn.', '{1}{R}, Sacrifice a land: Put a +1/+1 counter on Goblin Razerunners.\nAt the beginning of your end step, you may have Goblin Razerunners deal damage equal to the number of +1/+1 counters on it to target player or planeswalker.', '{1}{U}{R}: Dreadwing gets +3/+0 and gains flying until end of turn.', '{1}{W}, {T}: You gain 5 life.\n{1}{U}, {T}: Draw a card, then discard a card.\n{1}{B}, {T}: Target creature gets -2/-2 until end of turn.\n{1}{R}, {T}: Obelisk of Alara deals 3 damage to target player or planeswalker.\n{1}{G}, {T}: Target creature gets +4/+4 until end of turn.', '{1}{W}: Kranioceros gets +0/+3 until end of turn.', '{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Armillary Sphere: Search your library for up to two basic land cards, reveal them, put them into your hand, then shuffle.', '{3}{U}, {T}: Draw a card.', '{G}: Thornling gains haste until end of turn.\n{G}: Thornling gains trample until end of turn.\n{G}: Thornling gains indestructible until end of turn.\n{1}: Thornling gets +1/-1 until end of turn.\n{1}: Thornling gets -1/+1 until end of turn.', '{R}{G}{W}: Cylian Sunsinger and each other creature with the same name as it get +3/+3 until end of turn.', '{R}{W}, {T}: Sacellum Archers deals 2 damage to target attacking or blocking creature.', '{T}: Add one mana of any color that a land an opponent controls could produce.', '{T}: Add one mana of any color. Spend this mana only to cast a creature spell.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Target land you control becomes the basic land type of your choice until end of turn.', "{T}: Prevent the next 1 damage that would be dealt to any target this turn.\n{T}: Target creature can't be blocked this turn.", '{T}: Scattershot Archer deals 1 damage to each creature with flying.', '{T}: Target land you control becomes the basic land type of your choice until end of turn.', "{U}, {T}, Return an artifact you control to its owner's hand: You may put an artifact card from your hand onto the battlefield.", "{U}{B}: Vectis Agents gets -2/-0 until end of turn and can't be blocked this turn.", '{W}, {T}: Tap target permanent.', "{W}{B}: Scornful Aether-Lich gains fear and vigilance until end of turn. (Attacking doesn't cause it to tap, and it can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)", "{W}{U}, {T}: Put a bribery counter on target creature you don't control. Its controller draws a card.\nCreatures with bribery counters on them can't attack or block.", "{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}: Fleshformer gets +2/+2 and gains fear until end of turn. Target creature gets -2/-2 until end of turn. Activate only during your turn. (A creature with fear can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)"]
